  "worked_solution": "We are told that:  \n\nfor every $3$ students who prefer soccer there are $5$ students who prefer baseball\n\nSo, in a tape diagram, soccer´s tape must contain $3$ boxes, while the tape corresponding to baseball should have $5$ boxes.\n\nTherefore, the diagram is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14187307/assets/5098abed199db997b901675210c7289f2a85732881a1defeadc2e5f2b80d8086.png)",
